      "function": "Encloses the stator and supports the bearings; feet or flange mount the motor to the baseplate or pump.",
      "construction": "Totally enclosed fan-cooled (TEFC) frame with external cooling fins, drive-end and non-drive-end end shields, terminal box and lifting eye.",
      "material": "Cast iron or aluminium frame; steel fasteners.",
      "operating_conditions": "Frame size, enclosure (IP rating), efficiency class (e.g. IEC 60034-30-1 IE3/IE4) and insulation class per motor data sheet.",
      "failure_modes": [
        "Overheating from blocked fins or fan cover",
        "Soft foot causing frame distortion and vibration",
        "Moisture ingress at terminal box"
      ],
      "inspection": [
