      "construction": "Deep-groove ball bearings (roller bearing at drive end on larger belt-driven motors); one end locates axially.",
      "material": "Bearing steel; grease lubricated.",
      "operating_conditions": "Regrease interval depends on speed, size and temperature; insulated bearings recommended with VFDs to prevent electrical fluting.",
      "failure_modes": [
        "Lubrication failure",
        "Contamination",
        "Electrical erosion (fluting) with VFDs"
      ],
      "inspection": [
        "Temperature and vibration trend",
